Comment: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:21.72,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:28.73,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Federation sent a Medea squadron\Nto rescue the heavily damaged White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:41.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...but the squadron was attacked\Nby Goufs and Dodai bombers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.57,0:01:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro and the others hurried to assist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:52.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the help of the G-Parts\Ndesigned to power-up the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...they succeeded in defeating the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a poor joke.\NThis plan is absolutely ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten how many precious\Nresources M'Quve has sent us from under...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the Earth Federation's siege?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.17,0:02:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, the practical\Napplication of mobile armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. But the authority\Nof the military would be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A man's honor?! Military authority?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.95,0:02:38.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These things can be sacrificed\Nfor Zeon victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll save your honor once we win this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deliver the mobile suits for close combat\Non Earth to Commander Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:48.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Your Highness, we can't do it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:53.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just get them to Char before\Nhe joins the Mad Angler squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm sure there are heavy mobile suits\Nallocated to other units...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:03:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that can be used for combat on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should consider\Nsending those over too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you sent Doms to\Nthe Tri-Stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:11.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. They should have already left\Nsatellite orbit to rendezvous with M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good. Keep an eye on the situation\Nand respond accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As the occupier of the Moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Kycilia could not join\Nthe battle on Earth in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The fighting was unsettled on all fronts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The best she could do\Nwas to assist M'Quve...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...by sending her own brave warriors\Nknown as "Zeon's Tri-Stars".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:56.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:04:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? G-Good morning, Lt. Matilda!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Components for the Gundam's\Npower-up parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to do the repairs myself,\Nso I was organizing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:09.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:12.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Up to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty resourceful! I know a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:36.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You promised me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you'd fix the air conditioner in my room\Nonce you finished breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmph! Hmph! Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Ms. Matilda. She's just my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's elegant. And she's so nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:56.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd be a happy man\Nif I had a girlfriend like Ms. Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Idle hands make mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:04:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! Good morning! L-Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:05.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck finding an elegant girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Lieutenant!\NNow that I've made a total fool of myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:13.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask for permission to take\Na picture of you and myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem, as long as we do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes! ...I'm honored!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you guys give me a break?!\NThis only gives me 12 copies per photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me in, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:29.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm taking the picture! ...There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright. I've brought Lt. Matilda to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:41.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Please don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:48.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:08.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our forces are progressing too slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...especially since I want to move up\NOperation Odessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:14.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elran. Tell them to hurry and rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! However...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"However"? In the military,\Nthere is only action. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General Revil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An Air Force patrol team has sent us\Na report they caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Zeon Zanzibar warship\Nhas come down to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our Big Tray has already\Nconfirmed that information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:34.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Look at what it says after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Black Tri-Stars were dispatched\Nwith their new mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who captured me\Nat the Battle of Loum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're very tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got to begin Odessa Day earlier\Nthan we had anticipated. Right, Elran?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:52.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! Yes, I'll inform\Nall units at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're looking a bit pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:59.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Judock. You'd better not be spying\Nfor both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Revil is quite aware that the Black Tri-Stars\Nhave landed in a Zanzibar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-But that just can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell M'Quve that Operation Odessa\Nwill be commencing sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:15.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will we be able to finish\Nahead of schedule, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... That's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro. The Gundam's power-up parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:23.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you join the Supply Corps?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amid all the destruction of war...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it enables me to create things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Create things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While wars only bring destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I felt that human beings\Nneed more than that to go on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And we're clean now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe that you're a strong person,\NMs. Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How cheeky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Leave them to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're a whole different class than Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, show us the Trojan Horse\Nand this so-called white mobile suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:31.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ortega, Mash! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:32.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:58.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No metallic reaction detected...\NWe're jumping to the next mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:14.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enemy spotted. 3 mobile suits...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...approaching from 2 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare to intercept. Mirai, take charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- It's the enemy!\N- The enemy's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! All clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move Medea No. 3 out of\Nthe White Base's path!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad the controls are up here now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But can I really operate this by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hayato! Are you all right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you can work yours by yourself,\NMr. Kai, then I'll be fine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're past our second surveillance net.\NThey're moving quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the Gundam ready to go yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the problem...\NThey're still checking the G-Armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:57.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just told they need me down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:09:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By whom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Engineering Colonel Seki.\NHe wants me to operate the G-Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! Can't Job John do it?\NHe's a pilot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have experience with mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:11.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see... Let's have Fraw Bow\Ntake over your position for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:16.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The engine's just been overhauled.\NDon't forget to do a trial run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Fraw Bow. Please take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The computer takes care of the connection,\Nso the pilot doesn't have to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what if the computer gets damaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:34.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the laser sensors are synchronized,\Nit's possible to dock manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:37.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you'll stall if your speed\Nis under 600 km/h.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:39.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the G-Fighter pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:40.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:42.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This isn't the G-Fighter.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believe it's the G-Armor.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I handle this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For someone who's piloted the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it'll be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just rely on the machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be watching you from the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. See ya later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm still not finished checking. Hold on.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These guys are fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The engine output won't increase.\NEven if we manage to take off...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we have a specialist check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! Please ask Lieutenant Matilda\Nand Colonel Seki to come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, White Base?\NWhy haven't you taken off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main engine output won't increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! How are Amuro and Sayla\Ndoing with the G-Armor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:43.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like Sayla's having trouble with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She can't figure out\Nthe docking process with Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No time. Tell her to leave it to Amuro,\Nand just take off...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Please allow the G-Armor to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... G-Armor. Amuro and Sayla, launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:59.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Amuro, Ms. Sayla, please take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:02.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are for docking...\NFirst, then second...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Sayla! We're going!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Engines at max! Align takeoff axis! Ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To my left?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Sayla! Left!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In G-Armor mode, your cockpit\Nhas better control of the aircraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do it!\NIs the infrared monitor ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be firing the G-Armor's main cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're behind us! Turn us around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've gotta pull it harder!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.75,0:13:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Step on the pedal with all your might!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:41.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is tricky.\NIt's bigger, so it's much harder to turn...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:50.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the G-Armor's beam cannon power\Nlasts three times longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...than the Gundam's. We've got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rotate left, 90 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm aiming the beam cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:13:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Proceed at a 40 degree angle!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll swat you, you pesky fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not in the Trojan Horse's data, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.18,0:14:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a fighter-bomber,\Nbut I've never seen that silhouette before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Firing rear missiles,\Nangle minus 4 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Not bad, you mysterious fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no problem with\Nthe synchro-motor in itself? That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Check it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:47.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The G-Armor's having trouble in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both Guncannon and Guntank\Nare being forced back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:50.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Matilda!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. We can count on Colonel Seki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please have my Medea ready\Nfor takeoff at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:14:59.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We may be just a bit too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:04.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No particular reason. I somehow feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:10.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem to be a chronic worrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose I am.\NPeople do tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro. Sayla. Kai. Hayato.{\i}\N{\i1}Hang in there!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:32.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm such a useless klutz!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:41.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't even slow the enemy down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:44.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm okay! Where are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:16:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've advanced pretty far now.\NPlease hide us behind the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're converting to the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.57,0:16:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will I be able to dock the parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you can, Ms. Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you've always\Nsaid to me, Ms. Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:13.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're returning the favor?\NThen I'll give it a try, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pattern G automatic set.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's any problem, I will...\NNo, it'll be just fine! We'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,4... 3... 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...1... 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:43.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay, Ms. Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, the computer did it all for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, Amuro! Hurry back to the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? There's a Medea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not Ms. Matilda's Medea, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The pressure has increased\Nin No. 2 and No. 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rest are no good. In fact,\Nthe pressure seems to be decreasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We figured out the problem!{\i}\N{\i1}Just give us three minutes!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please finish it in two minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire main cannons!\NFire front missiles horizontally!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:23.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:28.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found you! I'm putting an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He dodged my shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The vulcans have no effect?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no! They've reached the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This Federation mobile suit!\NIt's not as great as they say!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're this close to making\Nthe White Base survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:09.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't sit around and watch it be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.45,0:18:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take off! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no! That mobile suit is planning\Nto destroy the White Base first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That pilot is no regular guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ortega! Mash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:31.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're gonna pull a Jet Stream Attack\Non that mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's quicker than I thought. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he... coming at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's working! Let's do the Jet Stream Attack\None more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? A Medea? But who's on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:15.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're coming...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He used me as a springboard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drive that Dom into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...! We almost had that mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't do anything to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mash's Dom... destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That mobile suit slipped\Npast our Jet Stream Attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:37.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No weapons left.\NWe need to rethink our tactics, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:56.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.28,0:20:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base repulsed\NZeon's Black Tri-Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:01.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's back on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:04.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,l-ls that so? ...Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, how about that White Base.\NIt's proven to be the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.21,0:21:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That crew...{\i}\N{\i1}How dare they?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where do they get their strength from?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:17.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elran.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Operation Odessa,\Nthe attack on M'Quve's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:23.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It begins at 0600 hours today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.73,0:21:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To express our sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.36,0:21:40.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...for the fallen members of Lieutenant Matilda's\NMedea transport squadron...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands! ...Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is all because of my inexperience...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Ms. Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.97,0:22:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.47,0:22:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.69,0:22:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.11,0:23:03.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.61,0:23:09.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,MS. MATILDA!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.13,0:23:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before Operation Odessa begins...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.17,0:23:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the traitors are discovered and arrested,\Nleading the Earth Federation to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.97,0:23:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the two surviving Black Tri-Star Doms\Nattack the Gundam relentlessly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:32.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...determined to avenge their fallen comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:36.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NThe Battle of Odessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
